{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02937","headline":"凝碧池侍宴看竞渡应制 · 李怀远","name":"凝碧池侍宴看竞渡应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上苑清銮路，高居重豫游。\n前对芙蓉沼，傍临杜若洲。\n地如玄扈望，波似洞庭秋。\n列筵飞翠斝，分曹戏鷁舟。\n湍高櫂影没，岸近榜歌遒。\n舞曲依鸾殿，箫声下凤楼。\n忽闻天上乐，疑逐海查流。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李怀远","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02937.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02937","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}